e / Wit<br data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\"><strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"734\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"796\">📦 <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"771\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"774\">Stihl AL 1 Acculader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"855\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"820\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"823\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
